## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of serverless design, per-tenant data isolation, and practical handling of concurrency, security, testing, and cost.

## Key Concepts

- Azure Functions HTTP bindings for simple APIs
- Cosmos DB SQL API with tenantId as partition key
- Optimistic concurrency via ETag
- Azure AD RBAC for per-tenant access control
- Unit testing HTTP handlers and Cosmos interactions
- Autoscale configuration to balance cost and load

## Code Example

